---
const lines = [
  {
    who: 'Pilot',
    text: 'Otopeni Tower, TAROM three zero one, holding point runway zero eight right, ready for departure.',
    trace: ['speech → text', 'intent: ready for departure', 'phase: holding → Tower'],
  },
  {
    who: 'Tower',
    text: 'TAROM three zero one, wind zero seven zero degrees eight knots, runway zero eight right, cleared for take-off.',
    trace: ['runway clear check', 'reply verified', 'text → speech'],
  },
  {
    who: 'Pilot',
    text: 'Cleared for take-off runway zero eight right, TAROM three zero one.',
    trace: ['readback matches clearance'],
  },
];
---

<figure class="radio" data-reveal>
  <div class="frame">
    <header class="top">
      <span class="label"><span class="local-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> LROP · Tower · on-device</span>
      <span class="chip">COM1</span>
    </header>
    <ol class="log">
      {
        lines.map((l) => (
          <li class:list={['line', l.who === 'Tower' && 'atc']}>
            <span class="who label">{l.who}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text">{l.text}</p>
              <p class="trace">
                {l.trace.map((t) => (
                  <span>{t}</span>
                ))}
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div class="clip">
      <p class="label">Recorded output · synthesised locally</p>
      <audio controls preload="none" src="/audio/atc-roger.mp3"></audio>
      <p class="quote">“Romeo Oscar Tango, tree zero one, roger.”</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="muted">
    The exchange above is illustrative. The audio clip is real output from the system's speech stage. Note the ICAO
    “tree” for three.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .radio {
    margin-block: 40px;
  }
  .frame {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--color-deep);
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .top .label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .log {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .line {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .who {
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .atc .who {
    color: var(--color-aurora);
  }
  .text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .atc .text {
    color: var(--color-ice);
  }
  .trace {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .trace span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--color-mist);
    padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-line);
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .clip {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  audio {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    height: 40px;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
  .quote {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-ice);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
